   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "A major reason President Washington favored the establishment of a national bank based on Alexander Hamilton’s plan was",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1168184,
     "content_html": "the success of the Bank of England"
    },
    {
     "id": 1168183,
     "content_html": "the need for investment in U.S. industry"
    },
    {
     "id": 1168185,
     "content_html": "the problems created by the lack of funding for the troops during the American Revolution"
    },
    {
     "id": 1168182,
     "content_html": "the national debt created by the French and Indian War"
    }
